== the first start and the actors' rooms
Without --unobserved-actor-rooms the first start is refused: taskcore through serve answers "the start holds 2 values the
reading did not reach: actorroom:1=0, actorroom:3=0" (sas: exit 7). The harness wrote 0 for every actorroom: fact (the
state dump has no actor room); the reader starts them not known (-1). reading.reached: actorroom:1 -1 28 41; actorroom:3
-1 28; actorroom:6 -1 0 28; actorroom:7 -1 0 41. With the actor rooms at -1: sas exit 0, 44605 operators.
The same first try also showed a fault in the start check through serve (a local import of re), fixed in 915a4cc.

