== door clicks
door 316, walk_to(316)[202]#1038: 4 clicks (one after the approach and the stone, three retries); 2 did nothing ("the
record's path never started"), 2 started; the fourth took ego into room 41. door 428: walk_to(428)#64, 1 click, judged not
started, while room 28 came one frame later. Without stepping stones: no click on door 316 was sent in 30 tries.

